  "instructions": [
    "Mix the meat, onion, tomato, cilantro, dill, water, rice, salt, and pepper. Stuff the cabbage leaves with the mixture.",
    "Sauté the onion and chicken necks for 10 minutes. Add the tomato and ½ of the garbanzo beans, then add half the stuffed cabbage, then the rest of the chickpeas, then the rest of the stuffed cabbage.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix the water, tomato sauce, and honey, then pour over the cabbage.",
    "Cover with a plate, bring to a boil, then turn down the heat while keeping bubbles forming on top.",
